title: 'Fix user losing remainder of swapped funds when pool liquidity goes below ED'
doc:
  - audience: Runtime Dev
    description: |
      `pallet-asset-conversion`'s `SwapCredit::swap_tokens_for_exact_tokens` split `credit_in`
      into the amount to swap and the change, and returned only the amount to swap if the swap
      then failed. The change was dropped inside the storage transaction that is rolled back on
      failure, so the caller lost it. The full `credit_in` is now returned on failure, as
      documented.
crates:
  - name: staging-xcm-executor
    bump: patch
  - name: staging-xcm-builder
    bump: none
  - name: pallet-asset-conversion
    bump: patch
